1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,300
红汤界的新顶流，来自贵州
The hottest new red broth: Guizhou

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,600
秘密藏在苗族一句老话
The secret's in an old Miao saying

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,900
以酸代盐——从前没盐，就吃酸
'Sour for salt' — no salt, so they soured it

4
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:09,200
红酸汤，用番茄和辣椒发酵
Red sour soup: fermented tomato and chili

5
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,500
装坛密封，发酵五六个月
Sealed in jars — five to six months

6
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,800
再磨浆，又发酵半个月
Ground to pulp, fermented again

7
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:16,100
一勺木姜子，整锅都活了
A spoon of litsea — the pot wakes up

8
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,400
酸辣鲜香，贵州话喊：板扎！
Sour-spicy-fresh — 'bǎnzā', awesome!

9
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,700
凯里酸汤鱼，国家级非遗
Kaili sour-soup fish: national heritage

10
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:23,000
麻辣、鲜甜、清水、还是酸？
Mala, umami, clear water — or sour?

11
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,300
火锅分几派？这一桌全是
How many hotpot schools? A whole table

12
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:27,600
从重庆到贵州，你站哪派？
Chongqing to Guizhou — which is yours?
